WEBVTT

00:00:15.845 --> 00:00:22.875
Tell me nanimo wakaranai no demo
Tell me I don't
understand anything, but

00:00:23.055 --> 00:00:30.045
You say itsumo sonna kotoba mo
You always say those
kinds of words, too

00:00:31.025 --> 00:00:37.795
Surechigau dake no
You find another way
You find another way where
we only pass each other by

00:00:38.265 --> 00:00:44.935
Owatteku sekai wo tobidashite
You know?
And rush out into a world
that's ending, you know?

00:00:45.245 --> 00:00:50.765
Hello Hello It's a New World
Hello, hello, it's a New World!

00:00:51.045 --> 00:00:54.485
Hikari yori hayaku
Faster than light,

00:00:55.255 --> 00:00:59.275
monokuro no supiido de
with monochromic speed

00:00:59.555 --> 00:01:05.115
Hello Hello It's a New World
Hello, hello, it's a New World!

00:01:05.325 --> 00:01:08.855
Jikan yori tooku
Farther than time,

00:01:09.665 --> 00:01:14.435
kakenukeru
You're so far away
I run through it;
you're so far away

00:01:29.985 --> 00:01:34.855
Twilight Moon

00:01:35.625 --> 00:01:38.145
Blood pressure decreasing,
pulse decreasing.

00:01:38.725 --> 00:01:41.855
There appears to be no
response to external stimuli.

00:01:42.565 --> 00:01:43.655
Braindead.

00:01:44.035 --> 00:01:45.155
You mean?

00:01:53.505 --> 00:01:56.105
No, the brain is still functioning.

00:01:58.585 --> 00:01:59.635
She's still logged in?

00:02:00.215 --> 00:02:02.345
Will she return to normal?

00:02:05.785 --> 00:02:08.315
We will do everything in our power.

00:02:09.555 --> 00:02:10.385
But...

00:02:11.095 --> 00:02:13.355
Why can't she log out?

00:02:19.305 --> 00:02:22.605
Rena!

00:02:36.555 --> 00:02:42.185
I'm dead. I'm dead. I'm dead.

00:02:43.095 --> 00:02:46.585
I'm dead. I'm dead.

00:02:46.825 --> 00:02:48.065
Please open your eyes.

00:02:48.065 --> 00:02:48.435
I'm dead. I'm dead.
Please open your eyes.

00:02:48.435 --> 00:02:50.365
I'm dead. I'm dead.

00:02:50.365 --> 00:02:51.265
I'm dead. I'm dead.
No. You are not yet dead.

00:02:51.265 --> 00:02:53.065
No. You are not yet dead.

00:02:57.005 --> 00:02:59.265
Open your eyes, Rena.

00:03:04.945 --> 00:03:06.915
Rena's been... hospitalized?

00:03:07.515 --> 00:03:08.715
Comatose.

00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:10.985
Not to mention, for unknown reasons.

00:03:11.485 --> 00:03:14.685
What do you mean
by "cannot log out"?

00:03:15.255 --> 00:03:16.345
I don't know.

00:03:17.295 --> 00:03:17.755
But...

00:03:18.465 --> 00:03:21.195
...Rena has to be somewhere
within "The World".

00:03:22.495 --> 00:03:23.395
I know it!

00:03:33.205 --> 00:03:36.705
It's hard not to say that Rena's...

00:03:37.045 --> 00:03:40.245
...disappearance in "The World" isn't...

00:03:40.615 --> 00:03:42.315
...related to the real life Rena's coma.

00:03:42.915 --> 00:03:46.085
That thing that looked like
Rena is of concern as well.

00:03:46.755 --> 00:03:49.385
It's too much of a coincidence.

00:03:49.625 --> 00:03:50.355
It seems...

00:03:51.295 --> 00:03:53.025
...there's something behind it all.

00:03:54.425 --> 00:03:55.195
What if...

00:03:55.395 --> 00:03:57.665
...we managed to find
the missing Rena.

00:03:58.635 --> 00:04:01.335
Will she regain
consciousness in real life?

00:04:02.205 --> 00:04:03.265
I think...

00:04:06.575 --> 00:04:07.475
You're Shugo.

00:04:07.945 --> 00:04:08.845
Why, are you here?

00:04:09.045 --> 00:04:11.235
Before you say anything
else, move your foot!

00:04:15.385 --> 00:04:16.145
Sanjuro.

00:04:17.115 --> 00:04:19.315
This is the area where
Rena disappeared?

00:04:25.425 --> 00:04:26.915
I checked the access logs.

00:04:27.895 --> 00:04:29.985
Since Rena was killed in this area...

00:04:30.365 --> 00:04:31.835
...she has not once logged out.

00:04:32.665 --> 00:04:33.435
It's the truth.

00:04:34.035 --> 00:04:35.835
So you've already investigated.

00:04:36.075 --> 00:04:38.905
I'm impressed, CC Corporation
Systems Administrator.

00:04:39.075 --> 00:04:41.405
Rena... Where is she?

00:04:50.555 --> 00:04:51.245
Who's there?

00:04:53.485 --> 00:04:53.925
Rena!?

00:04:53.955 --> 00:04:54.755
Lord Balmung!

00:05:05.565 --> 00:05:06.765
My second kiss...

00:05:06.805 --> 00:05:08.995
...was also stolen on the net.

00:05:09.235 --> 00:05:10.725
And with a guy at that.

00:05:11.345 --> 00:05:12.535
Why are you?

00:05:12.805 --> 00:05:14.105
What do you mean "why"?

00:05:14.505 --> 00:05:15.845
You're the one that ordered...

00:05:16.045 --> 00:05:17.235
...me to investigate this area.

00:05:17.575 --> 00:05:19.105
So. How was it?

00:05:19.685 --> 00:05:22.845
Um... A bitter rotten lemon taste.

00:05:23.615 --> 00:05:25.055
I wasn't talking about the kiss.

00:05:25.625 --> 00:05:26.715
I meant the investigation.

00:05:26.925 --> 00:05:28.085
Oh yes.

00:05:30.125 --> 00:05:31.145
There are definite traces of a...

00:05:31.365 --> 00:05:34.025
...gate having been forced open.

00:05:35.865 --> 00:05:36.725
Rena...

00:05:37.135 --> 00:05:39.605
...was teleported to somewhere else?

00:05:40.265 --> 00:05:41.825
Teleported! Where!

00:05:42.405 --> 00:05:46.435
Any kind of evidence
was cleanly deleted.

00:05:46.645 --> 00:05:49.115
So we don't know where?

00:05:49.775 --> 00:05:51.375
You guys are administrators?

00:05:52.015 --> 00:05:53.675
Administrating and investigating
are two different things!

00:05:54.685 --> 00:05:59.085
I toil daily to maintain
order within "The World".

00:05:59.525 --> 00:06:00.815
Is that so?

00:06:01.325 --> 00:06:05.085
But, you have been
searching for Rena.

00:06:05.825 --> 00:06:07.455
It's not just for Rena.

00:06:07.865 --> 00:06:10.225
What do you mean?

00:06:10.595 --> 00:06:11.585
There have been
numerous other users...

00:06:11.765 --> 00:06:13.295
...that have fallen into a coma...

00:06:13.835 --> 00:06:15.805
...while logged in...

00:06:16.405 --> 00:06:18.275
...and are currently hospitalized.

00:06:18.875 --> 00:06:21.065
In each case where the
users fell into a coma...

00:06:21.475 --> 00:06:24.505
...while in "The World" there were...

00:06:25.145 --> 00:06:26.875
...no signs that they had logged out.

00:06:27.385 --> 00:06:29.285
This is not your run of the mill trouble.

00:06:30.155 --> 00:06:32.345
Someone with an evil intent...

00:06:33.255 --> 00:06:35.655
...is trying to destroy this world.

00:06:36.125 --> 00:06:38.145
Evil intent, huh?

00:06:38.395 --> 00:06:41.085
I will not allow it!

00:06:46.565 --> 00:06:47.795
Where's the idiot Kite?

00:06:48.105 --> 00:06:49.195
It's Shugo.

00:06:49.535 --> 00:06:50.835
Whoever, doesn't matter.

00:06:51.005 --> 00:06:52.495
Shugo. Kite.

00:06:52.605 --> 00:06:53.575
He's loitering around the...

00:06:53.705 --> 00:06:56.575
..."Cursed Woodland Murderhouse".

00:06:56.675 --> 00:06:57.775
What a low IQ.

00:06:58.485 --> 00:07:00.005
Let's quit toying around and...

00:07:00.285 --> 00:07:04.275
...just get rid of him, like BlackRose.

00:07:04.515 --> 00:07:05.115
Rena.

00:07:05.725 --> 00:07:07.085
Whatever!

00:07:09.255 --> 00:07:11.455
Balmung of the Azure
Sky is with them.

00:07:12.065 --> 00:07:13.525
We can't do anything right now...

00:07:13.965 --> 00:07:15.485
...it'll just decrease our resources.

00:07:15.565 --> 00:07:16.325
Yeah.

00:07:16.795 --> 00:07:18.955
Oh. They're back.

00:07:24.475 --> 00:07:25.335
Twilight.

00:07:28.245 --> 00:07:29.505
We can see that.

00:07:29.775 --> 00:07:31.045
That's not it.

00:07:33.345 --> 00:07:35.945
The same thing happened
four years ago...

00:07:36.555 --> 00:07:39.075
...it was called the "Twilight" Incident.

00:07:40.525 --> 00:07:42.355
Many users met with injury...

00:07:43.155 --> 00:07:45.785
...and "The World" was on
the verge of destruction.

00:07:54.705 --> 00:07:56.365
The ones that resolved the incident...

00:07:57.105 --> 00:07:58.405
...were not CC Corporation...

00:07:58.975 --> 00:08:00.775
...but a user's party.

00:08:01.175 --> 00:08:03.505
I never heard of that incident!

00:08:04.075 --> 00:08:06.635
It's not recorded in "The World".

00:08:06.985 --> 00:08:08.955
CC Corporation erased all records.

00:08:09.255 --> 00:08:12.085
There are no official records left.

00:08:12.285 --> 00:08:15.255
But, it was a real incident.

00:08:17.655 --> 00:08:19.825
The people central to
its resolution were...

00:08:20.225 --> 00:08:21.785
Kite and BlackRose.

00:08:23.435 --> 00:08:24.795
That party was known as the...

00:08:25.805 --> 00:08:27.665
...dot hackers.

00:08:28.505 --> 00:08:29.975
"dot hackers"?

00:08:30.335 --> 00:08:31.805
I've heard of them.

00:08:32.145 --> 00:08:33.875
The party that was said to have...

00:08:33.875 --> 00:08:36.105
...solved the last
mystery of "The World"!

00:08:36.445 --> 00:08:38.675
That's what everyone knows.

00:08:39.545 --> 00:08:41.575
But that's just a rumor.

00:08:42.285 --> 00:08:44.615
How can you say that
with such certainty?

00:08:48.855 --> 00:08:49.915
Because Balmung and I...

00:08:49.955 --> 00:08:51.725
...were members of the dot Hackers.

00:08:56.935 --> 00:08:57.625
Well?

00:08:57.895 --> 00:08:59.385
No good. I've lost them.

00:08:59.535 --> 00:09:00.335
Same here.

00:09:00.435 --> 00:09:02.425
Man! Where did they go?

00:09:04.035 --> 00:09:05.665
A hideout, perhaps?

00:09:06.975 --> 00:09:07.875
What's that?

00:09:08.045 --> 00:09:09.635
It's one of those rare items.

00:09:10.315 --> 00:09:13.375
It'll be difficult to sneak
into one of those.

00:09:14.245 --> 00:09:15.015
What then?

00:09:15.655 --> 00:09:17.645
They have to pass through a...

00:09:18.015 --> 00:09:20.545
...Chaos Gate if they're
going to go somewhere.

00:09:21.755 --> 00:09:24.055
So there's no need to go
out of our way to find them.

00:09:24.965 --> 00:09:25.555
The enemy...

00:09:26.625 --> 00:09:29.025
...has been aware of
Shugo from the start.

00:09:29.635 --> 00:09:30.025
Me?

00:09:31.135 --> 00:09:34.065
The enemy knows of the
events from four years ago.

00:09:35.035 --> 00:09:36.435
And the obstacle to achieving their...

00:09:36.435 --> 00:09:37.905
...objectives would be Kite's Bracelet.

00:09:45.185 --> 00:09:47.545
From here on, the enemy
will be pursuing you.

00:09:48.415 --> 00:09:49.475
Understand, Shugo?

00:09:50.585 --> 00:09:51.075
Huh?

00:09:51.955 --> 00:09:53.385
Are you stupid?

00:09:56.955 --> 00:09:58.755
You don't have to say it that way!

00:10:33.825 --> 00:10:35.765
I've never heard that story.

00:10:36.565 --> 00:10:37.365
It's true.

00:10:37.995 --> 00:10:41.335
The rabbit in the moon
gives courage to travelers.

00:10:42.205 --> 00:10:43.795
When the traveler is in trouble...

00:10:44.235 --> 00:10:46.135
...it comes to save them!

00:10:54.115 --> 00:10:54.675
Rena.

00:10:59.555 --> 00:11:01.285
When Rena is in trouble...

00:11:01.795 --> 00:11:03.455
...I'll be her rabbit.

00:11:15.875 --> 00:11:17.065
Please open your eyes.

00:11:17.775 --> 00:11:19.265
Please open your eyes.

00:11:23.915 --> 00:11:24.435
Rena.

00:11:29.915 --> 00:11:30.905
A- Are you...

00:11:32.125 --> 00:11:33.085
...the rabbit?

00:11:36.155 --> 00:11:37.455
I am Aura.

00:11:38.125 --> 00:11:38.885
Aura?!

00:11:43.135 --> 00:11:43.855
Aura.

00:11:45.065 --> 00:11:45.895
My broth...

00:11:46.035 --> 00:11:48.055
...I mean Shugo said he'd met you.

00:11:48.205 --> 00:11:49.035
That is correct.

00:11:49.605 --> 00:11:53.045
Huh? I'm alive!

00:11:53.345 --> 00:11:53.735
Yes.

00:11:54.305 --> 00:11:57.035
But, I'm sure a monster got me.

00:11:57.675 --> 00:12:00.705
Huh? That was inside
the game though.

00:12:01.615 --> 00:12:06.715
Huh?! I'll log out and sort
things out in my head.

00:12:12.695 --> 00:12:16.185
Huh? Why can't I log out?

00:12:16.865 --> 00:12:19.125
Am I broken?

00:12:20.965 --> 00:12:21.625
A suggestion.

00:12:22.935 --> 00:12:24.765
When you were defeated
by the monster.

00:12:25.245 --> 00:12:28.205
An evil suggestion
was placed upon you.

00:12:29.145 --> 00:12:31.165
A suggestion that you were dead.

00:12:32.885 --> 00:12:33.745
A suggestion?

00:12:34.285 --> 00:12:35.305
Because of that influence...

00:12:35.685 --> 00:12:37.205
...the real world you...

00:12:38.015 --> 00:12:38.955
Died?

00:12:39.355 --> 00:12:40.085
Not yet.

00:12:40.625 --> 00:12:41.525
What you you mean, not yet?

00:12:42.195 --> 00:12:44.595
Your life still hangs by a thread.

00:12:45.125 --> 00:12:48.155
But, if it remains in
this state for long...

00:12:48.495 --> 00:12:49.485
T- that...

00:12:50.135 --> 00:12:51.865
You are not the only one.

00:12:52.705 --> 00:12:53.755
There are many others like you...

00:12:53.935 --> 00:12:55.265
...who have had this suggestion...

00:12:55.375 --> 00:12:57.565
...that they are dead.

00:12:57.705 --> 00:12:59.465
Now they spend their time in this area.

00:13:02.445 --> 00:13:04.275
T-this...

00:13:06.585 --> 00:13:09.175
But, can't you do something?

00:13:09.715 --> 00:13:11.845
Like how you gave
Shugo that bracelet.

00:13:12.255 --> 00:13:12.875
Please!

00:13:15.355 --> 00:13:18.385
My existence here is
but a shadowed one.

00:13:19.495 --> 00:13:22.935
It was all I could do to awaken you.

00:13:23.765 --> 00:13:25.825
What do I do to get rescued?

00:13:26.535 --> 00:13:28.265
There is only one hope.

00:13:31.305 --> 00:13:32.175
The rabbit?

00:13:35.375 --> 00:13:36.675
Leave it to me...

00:13:36.945 --> 00:13:39.415
...the Legendary Hero!

00:13:42.615 --> 00:13:44.815
Rena! Wait for me!

00:13:47.625 --> 00:13:50.755
Rena? Tres bien!

00:13:51.825 --> 00:13:55.695
"Gusting Southern Nation Snows"!

00:14:00.165 --> 00:14:02.105
"Gusting Southern Nation Snows"!

00:14:02.605 --> 00:14:03.225
Party members?

00:14:03.975 --> 00:14:04.735
Shugo is the only one.

00:14:05.345 --> 00:14:08.005
Hey, hey, hey. Let me do it.

00:14:08.645 --> 00:14:10.835
I made an interesting monster.

00:14:11.445 --> 00:14:12.435
Why is he alone?

00:14:13.145 --> 00:14:15.675
If he's got companions
they'd all just get smashed.

00:14:16.385 --> 00:14:17.905
Is it that high leveled?

00:14:18.655 --> 00:14:20.645
Don't ask something
you already know.

00:14:20.885 --> 00:14:22.785
All right, I'm leaving it to you.

00:14:23.195 --> 00:14:23.915
Alright!

00:14:25.095 --> 00:14:26.925
We have a lot to do too.

00:14:39.475 --> 00:14:40.495
Let's go!

00:14:45.585 --> 00:14:47.875
What is Shugo doing in this area?

00:14:48.485 --> 00:14:51.615
Probably... Not looking for a rare item.

00:14:52.285 --> 00:14:54.185
He must be looking for Rena. Ah...

00:14:58.295 --> 00:14:59.785
I- It's here!

00:15:07.805 --> 00:15:09.265
W-What is that monster!

00:15:09.975 --> 00:15:12.705
A Killer Snake? A Moonlighter?

00:15:13.045 --> 00:15:14.475
I've never seen anything like that!

00:15:14.975 --> 00:15:16.875
It's a merge of multiple monsters...

00:15:17.175 --> 00:15:18.205
...a constructed monster!?

00:15:20.315 --> 00:15:20.835
And now for the finish!

00:15:20.885 --> 00:15:21.975
No!

00:15:23.155 --> 00:15:25.175
You can't kill it! Sanjuro!

00:15:25.525 --> 00:15:28.215
The enemy will come to kill me.

00:15:28.955 --> 00:15:30.785
Then like Rena...

00:15:31.325 --> 00:15:33.655
...I'll be teleported
through the invisible gate.

00:15:34.495 --> 00:15:35.055
Right?

00:15:36.095 --> 00:15:36.795
Shugo.

00:15:37.335 --> 00:15:40.425
If I find out what the
gate connects to...

00:15:40.865 --> 00:15:42.565
...I can save Rena!

00:15:42.935 --> 00:15:45.165
I see! So that was the plan!

00:15:45.675 --> 00:15:48.305
There must be a program coded in it...

00:15:48.775 --> 00:15:51.745
...that opens the gate
when the enemy is killed.

00:15:52.115 --> 00:15:54.635
If I can analyze it, I will
know where Rena is!

00:15:55.085 --> 00:15:55.845
Shugo.

00:15:58.315 --> 00:16:01.485
It seems. There's no fear of overkill.

00:16:02.495 --> 00:16:03.145
Shugo!

00:16:03.655 --> 00:16:04.625
Data Drain.

00:16:05.265 --> 00:16:07.195
Weaken it so that we can capture it.

00:16:07.365 --> 00:16:08.155
I know.

00:16:09.565 --> 00:16:11.055
Data Drain!!

00:16:21.975 --> 00:16:23.465
K-Komiyama!!

00:16:28.215 --> 00:16:29.805
Data Drain!

00:16:31.215 --> 00:16:34.385
Shugo, you don't have
enough skill points!

00:16:36.495 --> 00:16:38.685
Sanjuro and I will hold it off!

00:16:39.425 --> 00:16:41.325
I'll help, too!

00:16:42.965 --> 00:16:43.955
Mireille! Hotaru!

00:16:44.335 --> 00:16:46.425
Help Shugo recover his Skill Points!

00:16:46.735 --> 00:16:47.465
Okaaaay!

00:16:52.945 --> 00:16:53.375
Wait!

00:16:56.315 --> 00:16:58.005
You're not recovered yet!

00:16:58.315 --> 00:16:59.045
But...

00:16:59.685 --> 00:17:00.735
Ohka and the others.

00:17:01.115 --> 00:17:01.845
Hurry.

00:17:02.555 --> 00:17:05.145
Recover. Hurry.

00:17:15.095 --> 00:17:16.395
Recovery complete!

00:17:16.935 --> 00:17:17.655
OK!

00:17:17.995 --> 00:17:19.365
All right!

00:17:19.865 --> 00:17:21.265
Data?!

00:17:32.145 --> 00:17:33.875
W-Who are they?

00:17:34.545 --> 00:17:35.205
Cerulean...

00:17:35.815 --> 00:17:36.545
Knights!

00:17:43.625 --> 00:17:45.385
Formation Delta!

00:17:55.165 --> 00:17:57.265
Stop! You mustn't kill it!

00:17:57.475 --> 00:17:58.465
Delete!

00:18:03.375 --> 00:18:05.535
Stop it! If you delete it then Rena...

00:18:06.845 --> 00:18:08.175
Don't let your heart confuse you!

00:18:13.985 --> 00:18:15.215
Operation complete.

00:18:15.725 --> 00:18:16.715
Prepare to withdraw.

00:18:17.595 --> 00:18:18.145
Kamui.

00:18:22.595 --> 00:18:24.425
Unfair!

00:18:24.695 --> 00:18:25.565
How is it unfair?

00:18:26.565 --> 00:18:27.265
Not bad.

00:18:28.065 --> 00:18:30.505
CC Corporation's
getting serious as well.

00:18:31.135 --> 00:18:31.905
Interesting.

00:18:38.985 --> 00:18:39.875
Rena...

00:18:41.185 --> 00:18:41.775
Kamui.

00:18:43.885 --> 00:18:44.785
Balmung...

00:18:47.125 --> 00:18:47.785
Kamui.

00:18:49.755 --> 00:18:50.815
Balmung.

00:18:52.995 --> 00:18:53.795
Kamui!

00:18:54.795 --> 00:18:56.995
Are you trying to say you love me?

00:18:58.335 --> 00:18:59.235
Those two...

00:18:59.505 --> 00:19:00.965
Are they involved that way?

00:19:01.265 --> 00:19:02.035
Dunno.

00:19:02.775 --> 00:19:04.325
Why are you here?

00:19:05.275 --> 00:19:07.075
Why are you interfering with us?

00:19:08.045 --> 00:19:09.535
You just blew the plan...

00:19:10.145 --> 00:19:12.445
...to find the missing people.

00:19:12.915 --> 00:19:15.945
Your new love, don't you mean?

00:19:16.285 --> 00:19:17.305
No!

00:19:17.815 --> 00:19:20.515
There's no way Balmung
would be Rena's lover!

00:19:21.555 --> 00:19:24.455
I have a new love too.

00:19:24.925 --> 00:19:25.625
Love?

00:19:27.965 --> 00:19:29.365
Reki, you?

00:19:30.295 --> 00:19:32.525
Love is blind, right?

00:19:33.335 --> 00:19:34.265
One more thing...

00:19:35.105 --> 00:19:36.125
...this incident has been...

00:19:36.375 --> 00:19:39.275
...transferred to the jurisdiction
of the Cerulean Knights.

00:19:40.975 --> 00:19:44.135
It's a CC Corporation
upper division decision.

00:19:44.975 --> 00:19:47.105
The mail should arrive soon.

00:19:47.985 --> 00:19:48.945
This incident...

00:19:49.785 --> 00:19:51.875
...is going to be transferred to you?

00:19:52.225 --> 00:19:53.915
If you have a problem
take it to the higher-ups.

00:19:54.485 --> 00:19:55.255
Lady Kamui...

00:19:55.595 --> 00:19:57.185
Data maintenance is complete.

00:19:59.225 --> 00:20:00.155
Withdraw.

00:20:02.025 --> 00:20:03.895
I love you, Balmung.

00:20:04.295 --> 00:20:06.195
As long as you don't get in my way.

00:20:10.705 --> 00:20:12.295
What's with them?

00:20:12.845 --> 00:20:14.005
They suddenly show up...

00:20:14.305 --> 00:20:17.765
...and ruin my
super-duper rescue plan.

00:20:18.615 --> 00:20:19.845
The Cerulean Knights.

00:20:20.385 --> 00:20:21.275
The CC Corporation's...

00:20:21.545 --> 00:20:23.275
...counter-net terrorism force.

00:20:23.685 --> 00:20:24.675
In other words...

00:20:25.285 --> 00:20:28.415
...their job is to go around
and unmask terrorists.

00:20:29.125 --> 00:20:31.645
To unmask terrorists no matter what.

00:20:32.325 --> 00:20:33.025
Then...

00:20:33.725 --> 00:20:34.355
Rena...

00:20:35.125 --> 00:20:36.995
It's not a part of their job.

00:20:37.635 --> 00:20:39.225
To search for the missing people.

00:20:39.965 --> 00:20:41.405
Lord Balmung!

00:20:41.865 --> 00:20:44.065
They're your friends right.

00:20:44.505 --> 00:20:46.335
Do something!

00:20:46.805 --> 00:20:47.335
It's already...

00:20:47.975 --> 00:20:48.775
Already?

00:20:49.145 --> 00:20:49.735
Too late.

00:20:50.145 --> 00:20:50.765
Why?

00:20:52.015 --> 00:20:52.745
Because...

00:20:53.215 --> 00:20:55.305
Because why?

00:20:55.855 --> 00:20:56.645
Because...

00:20:57.655 --> 00:20:58.385
The sword...

00:21:00.155 --> 00:21:01.015
Cannot win against love!

00:21:06.725 --> 00:21:10.255
S-Stop joking around!

00:21:50.175 --> 00:21:50.635
Preview

00:21:50.635 --> 00:21:52.705
Preview
I have secret information!

00:21:52.705 --> 00:21:53.105
Preview

00:21:53.105 --> 00:21:54.205
Preview
Did you know, Shugo?

00:21:54.205 --> 00:21:54.405
Preview

00:21:54.405 --> 00:21:55.045
Preview
There used to be a...

00:21:55.045 --> 00:21:55.075
Preview

00:21:55.075 --> 00:21:56.645
Preview
...group called the Crimson
Knights in "The World".

00:21:56.645 --> 00:21:58.405
...group called the Crimson
Knights in "The World".

00:21:58.985 --> 00:22:00.705
That means that guy is...

00:22:02.215 --> 00:22:04.985
The Solitary Knight

00:22:06.625 --> 00:22:17.055
Hashitteyuku kodomotachi
no hashagu warai goe ni
In the running
children's frolicking voices

00:22:17.435 --> 00:22:24.965
Hikari to kage oikakete mitaku naru
They want to chase
the light and shadows

00:22:28.245 --> 00:22:38.705
Midori no ha ni sukashite
mita ano taiyou no saki ni
Watching the sun shine
between the green leaves,

00:22:39.025 --> 00:22:47.795
Nani ga aru to omotteita no darou
wondering if something is there.

00:22:49.135 --> 00:22:59.335
Emerald Green hana wo
tsunda te no naka kara
From inside the hands picking,
the emerald green flowers

00:22:59.775 --> 00:23:10.275
Sora kaze tsuchi e to
sugata wo kaeteyuku
change their body to the
sky, the wind, the ground.

00:23:10.555 --> 00:23:22.485
Sono utsukushisa ni me wo
hiraita mabushi sugiru basho de
Laying in that opulent place that
opened its eyes to that beauty,

00:23:22.795 --> 00:23:30.395
Nekoronda sora ni toikaketeru
Asking questions to the sky
